## Consequences

- This repository is a **mixed-licence collection** only because of fifteen
  imported symbols. `LICENSE` (MIT) covers every 3D model and every other
  symbol and footprint, and the files say so.
- All 144 remaining models are MIT. The fifty-four third-party models removed
  here are gone with their `(model ...)` references; the footprints keep their
  pads, courtyard and fab outline and ship without a body.
- The Keyswitch KiCad Library models are **MIT** under the option elected here;
  `LICENSE-kiswitch` carries their copyright and permission notice.
- No model or symbol in the collection is under a NoDerivatives or a
  non-commercial licence. The ones that were — `Fuse_PPTC1.stp` under CC BY-ND,
  the ScottoKeebs models under CC BY-NC-SA and their three footprints — have
  been removed.
- Before the next release: replace the fifteen imported symbols with original
  drawings or obtain permission; keep the SnapEDA, Samacsys and kiswitch
  attributions with the files.

